{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A visual novel in the romance and adventure genre. You awaken in the Honeycombs \u2014 a camp where memory is a privilege and the past a forbidden secret. Here, amidst dense forests and the rigid walls of the Continental Union, your memories are stripped away, yet a voice from your dreams beckons you back. Someone holds the truth. Someone buries it in lies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565590/extras/desc_3.jpg?t=1742472779\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every day is a test. Prove your mettle, forge bonds in the shadows, and uncover secrets that hum in the night. Your choices decide all: will you remain a drone in their hive or spark the blaze of freedom? The camp quivers under war\u2019s shadow, and time slips away. Remember who you are before it\u2019s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to a tale where truth is your only escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565590/extras/desc_1.png?t=1742472779\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">RPG system with skill progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choices that affect the story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Map movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many arts</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3565590?t=1742472779","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3565590?t=1742472779","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565590/5967311397ff87d7b57bbe3db37d1bb2307f0da9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742472779","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565590/5967311397ff87d7b57bbe3db37d1bb2307f0da9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742472779","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A visual novel in the romance and adventure genre. You awaken in the Honeycombs \u2014 a camp where memory is a privilege and the past a forbidden secret. Here, amidst dense forests and the rigid walls of the Continental Union, your memories are stripped away, yet a voice from your dreams beckons you back. Someone holds the truth. Someone buries it in lies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565590/extras/desc_3.jpg?t=1742472779\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every day is a test. Prove your mettle, forge bonds in the shadows, and uncover secrets that hum in the night. Your choices decide all: will you remain a drone in their hive or spark the blaze of freedom? The camp quivers under war\u2019s shadow, and time slips away. Remember who you are before it\u2019s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to a tale where truth is your only escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565590/extras/desc_1.png?t=1742472779\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">RPG system with skill progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choices that affect the story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Map movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many arts</p></li></ul>","developers":["Daniil Tarasau"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565590/0a9ab45376464fec37c95bb2862ffb6170c55e17/header.jpg?t=1742472779","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],